## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to architect scalable, secure data ingestion across accounts with governance at scale, matching enterprise needs from Databricks and Salesforce.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-account IAM roles and resource policies
- Lake Formation governance and Glue Data Catalog
- Per-tenant S3 isolation and partitioning strategy
- KMS key management and envelope encryption
- Audit/logging with CloudTrail, Config, and Lake Formation logs

